 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-19","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.92","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.92/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"1cf19e2ee54c7e224ae2fcd4e66d7f4a2b01aefa1e18b2f80e40b2fc48023225"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.92/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"c40c3bd31b28c8690d811696acb37e2e44bfe1c13dfbe878129580a610e5c0a8"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.92/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"bf98e8a1ff1527180358770b8d81f23c8f0dc55f9ef296006b5dded086de7cb8"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.92/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"e32a50d93c09ed912c7d230249ecd7a38120decd20c322ed13dda6f8af832e8e"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.92"}